              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You are not learning a new list of stem-changing verbs. You are carrying one known change into one known row. Quiero que quieras hablar español means “I want you to want to speak Spanish.” The sentence is deliberately narrow: no new person noun, object, or plural form."
            }
